liderada por el multinstrumentista, DJ y productor Nova, nacido en República Dominicana.","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Pacha_Massive","cita":"is a Latin alternative band led by Dominican-born multi-instrumentalist, DJ and producer Nova"},{"dato":"Fue el primer fichaje estadounidense del sello Nacional Records.","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Pacha_Massive","cita":"Formed in the Bronx, New York in 2005, the band was Nacional Records’ first U.S.-based signing."},{"dato":"Su tema «Don't Let Go» apareció en la banda sonora del videojuego FIFA 08.","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Pacha_Massive","cita":"Their track \"Don't Let Go\" was also featured on the EA Sports soundtrack of the video game FIFA 08"}]}
